  "statSections": [
    {
      "name": "Traits",
      "rulesText": "Demonic Restoration. If the marilith dies outside the Abyss, its body dissolves into ichor, and it gains a new body instantly, reviving with all its Hit Points somewhere in the Abyss.\n\nMagic Resistance. The marilith has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.\n\nReactive. The marilith can take one Reaction on every turn of combat.",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
        "section": "12.158",
        "heading": "Traits",
        "lineStart": 22919,
        "lineEnd": 22925
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Actions",
      "rulesText": "Multiattack. The marilith makes six Pact Blade attacks and uses Constrict.\n\nPact Blade. Melee Attack Roll: +10, reach 5 ft. Hit: 10 (1d10 + 5) Slashing damage plus 7 (2d6) Necrotic damage.\n\nConstrict. Strength Saving Throw: DC 17, one Medium or smaller creature the marilith can see within 5 feet. Failure: 15 (2d10 + 4) Bludgeoning damage. The target has the Grappled condition (escape DC 14), and it has the Restrained condition until the grapple ends.",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
        "section": "12.158",
        "heading": "Actions",
        "lineStart": 22927,
        "lineEnd": 22933
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Bonus Actions",
      "rulesText": "Teleport (Recharge 5–6). The marilith teleports up to 120 feet to an unoccupied space it can see.",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
        "section": "12.158",
        "heading": "Bonus Actions",
        "lineStart": 22935,
        "lineEnd": 22937
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Reactions",
      "rulesText": "Parry. Trigger: The marilith is hit by a melee attack roll while holding a weapon. Response: The marilith adds 5 to its AC against that attack, possibly causing it to miss.",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
        "section": "12.158",
        "heading": "Reactions",
        "lineStart": 22939,
        "lineEnd": 22941
      }
    }
  ],
  "rulesText": "Large Fiend (Demon), Chaotic Evil\n\nAC 16\nInitiative +10 (20)\nHP 220 (21d10 + 105)\nSpeed 40 ft., Climb 40 ft.\n\nSkills Perception +8\nResistances Cold, Fire, Lightning\nImmunities Poison; Poisoned\nSenses Truesight 120 ft.; Passive Perception 18\nLanguages Abyssal; telepathy 120 ft.\nCR 16 (XP 15,000; PB +5)\n\nTraits\n\nDemonic Restoration. If the marilith dies outside the Abyss, its body dissolves into ichor, and it gains a new body instantly, reviving with all its Hit Points somewhere in the Abyss.\n\nMagic Resistance. The marilith has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.\n\nReactive. The marilith can take one Reaction on every turn of combat.\n\nActions\n\nMultiattack. The marilith makes six Pact Blade attacks and uses Constrict.\n\nPact Blade. Melee Attack Roll: +10, reach 5 ft. Hit: 10 (1d10 + 5) Slashing damage plus 7 (2d6) Necrotic damage.\n\nConstrict. Strength Saving Throw: DC 17, one Medium or smaller creature the marilith can see within 5 feet. Failure: 15 (2d10 + 4) Bludgeoning damage. The target has the Grappled condition (escape DC 14), and it has the Restrained condition until the grapple ends.\n\nBonus Actions\n\nTeleport (Recharge 5–6). The marilith teleports up to 120 feet to an unoccupied space it can see.\n\nReactions\n\nParry. Trigger: The marilith is hit by a melee attack roll while holding a weapon. Response: The marilith adds 5 to its AC against that attack, possibly causing it to miss.",
